// Runs once per SEED_VERSION: rows use fixed ids, sample listings are
// upserted (so content updates reach existing databases) and accounts are
// only created if missing. Set
// LEASEMATCH_DISABLE_SEED=1 to skip it entirely.
//
// The sample provider accounts can be logged into to see the provider side
// of the app — all three share SAMPLE_PROVIDER_PASSWORD below. These are
// local-dev test credentials only.

